<title>UK: Reuters 4th ex-UK-Africa air cargo market report.</title>
<headline>Reuters 4th ex-UK-Africa air cargo market report.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK air cargo rates to Africa per kg for a 100 kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one.</p>
<p>		   April 30	    April 09</p>
<p> LON-ACC	  0.95		  0.95</p>
<p> LON-EBB	  1.00		  1.00</p>
<p> LON-HRE	  1.43		  1.45</p>
<p> LON-JNB	  1.55		  1.60</p>
<p> LON-LBV	  2.42		  2.41</p>
<p> LON-LOS	  0.97		  0.95</p>
<p> LON-NBO	  0.93		  0.95</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on a confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices are quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative of current market activity.</p>
</text>
